{"path":"numeric/valarray/swap2","title":"std::swap(std::valarray)","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>swap<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">(std::valarray)</span>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/numeric/valarray/swap2","section":"numeric","kind":"page","summary":"Specializes the std::swap algorithm for std::valarray. Swaps the contents of lhs and rhs. Calls lhs.swap(rhs).","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/valarray\">&lt;valarray&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> T <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> swap<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/valarray\"><span class=\"kw1481\">std::<span class=\"me2\">valarray</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> lhs, <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/valarray\"><span class=\"kw1481\">std::<span class=\"me2\">valarray</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> rhs <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Specializes the <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/swap\">std::swap</a></span> algorithm for <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/valarray\">std::valarray</a></span>. Swaps the contents of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">lhs</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rhs</span></code>. Calls <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">lhs.<span class=\"me1\">swap</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>rhs<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> lhs, rhs\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> valarrays whose contents to swap\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<p>Constant.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;valarray&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">void</span> print<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> rem, <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/valarray\"><span class=\"kw1481\">std::<span class=\"me2\">valarray</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> v<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> rem <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'{'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">char</span> sep<span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">0</span>, <span class=\"st0\">' '</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> elem <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> v<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> sep <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> elem, <span class=\"sy2\">*</span>sep <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"st0\">','</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"}<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/valarray\"><span class=\"kw1481\">std::<span class=\"me2\">valarray</span></span></a> x<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">3</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">4</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">5</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/valarray\"><span class=\"kw1481\">std::<span class=\"me2\">valarray</span></span></a> y<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">2</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">7</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">8</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    print<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"Before swap:<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"x: \"</span>, x<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    print<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"y: \"</span>, y<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/swap\"><span class=\"kw1611\">std::<span class=\"me2\">swap</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>x, y<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    print<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"After swap:<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"x: \"</span>, x<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    print<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"y: \"</span>, y<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>Before swap:\nx: {3, 1, 4, 1, 5}\ny: {2, 7, 1, 8}\nAfter swap:\nx: {2, 7, 1, 8}\ny: {3, 1, 4, 1, 5}</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/valarray/swap\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>swap</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  swaps with another valarray <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"numeric","title":"Numerics library"},{"path":"numeric/valarray","title":"std::valarray"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::swap(std::valarray)","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++11. Specializes the std::swap algorithm for std::valarray. Swaps the contents of lhs and rhs."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"lhs, rhs"},{"label":"Return value","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Complexity","note":"Constant."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"swap","note":"swaps with another valarray"}]}]},"standards":["C++11"],"wordCount":155,"codeBlockCount":2}
